    "question": {
      ":question/id": "853c887e-b982-5964-b1a4-6d56277f6200",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices has a rank of $4?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "First, notice that a matrix of rank $4$ must have at least $4$ columns and at least $4$ rows. \nSo, we disregard the following matrices:\n\n- $A$ since it has only $2$ rows.\n\n- $B$ since it has only $3$  rows.\n\n- $D$ since it has only $3$ columns.\n\nAlso, the matrix must have $4$ pivot columns. As we can see, the matrix $C$ has exactly $4$ pivot columns, while the matrix $E$ has only $3$ pivot columns. So, $\\text{rank}(C)=4$ and $\\text{rank}(E)=3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the matrix $C.$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "a7fc0df2-f97e-54bf-9a0a-7ad713c92ca8",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1efd9ee1-063c-5b2d-ba68-df24c66a83f8",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "D=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "2c0cfd15-4f8d-53fc-a0c4-b867ff938def",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "b754a332-de79-5a85-8d67-a3270a83e377",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "dcb142ca-a7f1-5f40-b355-7b966d1b54d5",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "bb9962d3-9b4e-57da-a932-7ba9db342d62",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "bb9962d3-9b4e-57da-a932-7ba9db342d62"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
